OL,3,GNEWSAFestive market cancels bookings
OL,4,Aafter AI backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organisers of a Christmas market
OL,7,Fhave cancelled all bookings and
OL,8,Fpromised to refund stallholders
OL,9,Ffollowing a backlash to AI-generated
OL,10,Fpromotional materials.
OL,12,FDavid Rowland, who produced the images
OL,13,Ffor Kernow Christmas Market in Pool,
OL,14,FCornwall, said claims they did not
OL,15,Fmatch reality were a "lesson learned".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
