OL,3,GNEWSAFestive market cancels bookings
OL,4,Aafter AI backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FImages showed rows of stalls beneath
OL,7,FChristmas decorations, fairy lights and
OL,8,Ffestive displays for the event last
OL,9,Fweekend. But photographs taken by
OL,10,Fvisitors showed a mostly empty hall
OL,11,Fwith only a handful of traders, little
OL,12,FChristmas decoration and buckets on the
OL,13,Ffloor collecting water from a leaking
OL,14,Froof.
OL,16,FRowlands Attractions said it was
OL,17,F"gutted" things "didn't go as planned".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
